  "history": [
    {
      "date": "2026-02-23",
      "description": "Reduced effect radius from 6 tiles to 5 tiles. Range Removed totem damage. Damage Removed the ability to benefit from Life Aura from the Life Gem or Apprentice Warden."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-04-27",
      "description": "图腾不再受到英雄火炬的技能效果影响。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://supercell.com/en/games/clashofclans/blog/release-notes/the-sound-of-clash-update/",
      "sourcePublishedOn": "2026-04-27"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-08-31",
      "description": "修复图腾被错误按 20 人口计算的问题，改为 1 人口，避免过快触发暗黑皇冠或消耗擎天箭矢的部署人口额度。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://supercell.com/en/games/clashofclans/blog/release-notes/august-update-3/",
      "sourcePublishedOn": "2026-08-30",
      "dateSourceUrl": "https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Diggy?oldid=625147#History"
    }
  ],
  "facts": [
    "The Totem Spell is the tenth Elixir spell unlocked, when the Spell Factory is upgraded to level 9, requiring Town Hall 16."
  ],
